CM_ SG_ 1784 gripper_action_status "the action bit of the last Send_gripper_data_pack (1 after #Grippos); the driver never clears it, so it stays 1 after the move ends: the object detection tells when the move has ended";
CM_ SG_ 1784 gripper_object_detection_raw "bit 5 is the low bit, bit 4 the high bit: 0 moving, 1 object detected while closing, 2 object detected while opening, 3 at the position; raw bit pair, see value labels (wire order differs from numeric status)";
CM_ SG_ 1784 gripper_temperature_error "the driver's temperature error";
CM_ SG_ 1784 gripper_timeout_error "the driver's watchdog error: the CAN watchdog ran out";
